(ert-deftest hive-mcp-channel-test-oversize-declared-length-is-malformed nil "A declared string length above `hive-mcp-channel-max-frame-bytes' is\nmalformed at once, with or without its colon." (dolist (frame (list "99999999999:" "99999999999" "d4:type99999999999:ping"))
